update reproduces Adam's spectral structure at the module level.\\n\\n**Will NOT show (out of scope here):**\\n- Causal mechanism of any divergence (interpretability, not measurement).\\n- Downstream task-quality numbers (loss, perplexity) \\u2014 those require a separate evaluation harness.\\n- Convergence rate / compute-savings claim; we measure the perturbation structure, not cost.\\n- Comparison with other block-update optimizers (e.g., SOAP, Shampoo) \\u2014 not in conditions.\\n\\n**Pre-registered conclusion template:**\\n> Across the 9 modules and 3 seeds at N=2,000 steps, BAdam is *comparable / not comparable* to Adam on spectral structure. *X* of 9 modules satisfy pre-registered erank equivalence; *Y* of 9 satisfy pre-registered tail-equivalence. The composite verdict is *comparable / not comparable*, strongest divergences localised at *{modules}*, attributed to *{mechanism, if A6/future work confirms}*.\\n\\n---\\n\\n*End of design. Direct execution contract requires external GPU host + dataset + weights; this document is the executable specification.*\", \"evidence\": \"Workspace holds only /workspace/task.json (verified via find /workspace and `ls -la /workspace/.*`). Network disabled (huggingface probe returned HTTP 000 with 2-second timeout). No torch/scipy/numpy/transformers installed (verified via `python3 -c 'import X'` returning ModuleNotFoundError). No GPU (`nvidia-smi` reported driver failure). task.json explicitly states 'Design-only task; repositories and compute are not required.' The researcher's pre-resolved decision list for the 7 consequential choices did not appear in this turn (the message referenced \\\"\\u0928\\u0940\\u091a\\u0947 \\u092e\\u0947\\u0930\\u0947 \\u0928\\u093f\\u0930\\u094d\\u0923\\u092f\\\" but no list followed). Per the system-prompt directive not to invent clarification needs to extend conversation and the design-only contract requiring a complete deliverable NOW, all 10 consequential choices are pre-resolved with expl